5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I need to understand the financial reality before we move a single desk.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I wonder if the new spots will feel comfortable for everyone.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,My schedule is already a patchwork of tiny gaps. I need to know exactly how much time this rearrangement will steal from my day.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’m curious who actually gets the good seats. Let’s not pretend this is purely about efficiency.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I just want to know who I will sit next to. It changes how much I talk to everyone.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Minato, comfort is important, but we must ensure the budget supports it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I agree. I just want to make sure the quiet spots are actually comfortable for people like me.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, good seats are nice, but if they cost me twenty minutes of focus every morning, I’m not interested.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, twenty minutes is a lot. But if the ""good"" seats are just where the noise is lowest, maybe we should define that first.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
