35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,We are paying forty-one thousand yen monthly for empty desks. The facilities quote is six thousand yen per move.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, I found the printer side is nine decibels louder. Also, the physio says chairs take days to adjust properly.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"@Victoria, four to nine minutes daily is a disaster for my gaps. Plus, those shuffles meant two weeks of chaos.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, nine decibels is a significant difference. And if chairs take days to settle, frequent shuffles are just a recipe for chronic discomfort.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minato, the survey says daylight is the biggest complaint, but the plan ignores it. I worry about who gets stuck in the dark.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@May, those shuffles are exactly why we need a stable layout. Every move costs six thousand yen and disrupts your focus.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, I agree. If moving desks takes days to settle, it really hurts my body. I hope we can find a spot that stays put.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, exactly. Stability is non-negotiable for me. I can’t afford another fortnight of chaos.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, stability is key, but we must also address the noise disparity. We can’t just hide the problem by keeping the layout static.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, I agree. But if we fix the seats, I need to know who sits beside me. It changes how much I actually talk to people.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Shunichi, I hear you, but the billing is area-based. We must justify every square meter we occupy before adding complexity.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I understand the cost. But if I sit in a loud spot, my body hurts. I really need a quiet place to rest.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, I get the pain, but I need to know if a fixed spot actually saves me time. I can’t afford daily setup delays.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, a fixed spot means you plug in and go. No daily setup. But we must explicitly assign the loud row to those who don’t mind it.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, I think a fixed spot helps. I just need to know who is next to me, so I can feel safe talking.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I am leaning toward fixed desks. It minimizes the six thousand yen per move and stops the billing waste.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I agree. A fixed spot means my chair can finally settle. I really hope we can keep it that way.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"@Victoria, fixed desks mean zero setup time. That is the only way I protect my gaps. I am fully on board with stability.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, I agree. Fixed desks are the only rational choice. But we must explicitly assign the loud row to those who tolerate it, rather than letting it fall to chance.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Victoria, I agree. Fixed desks are good. But please, let us choose our neighbors deliberately, not by accident.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
