66,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Daisuke, I hope we can sit near the window. It is quieter there, and I think it would help me feel calm.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"@Daisuke, I get it, but if I have to hunt for a seat every morning, my gaps vanish. Option A is the only way I stay sane.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, Option A lets us name the seats. We can deliberately place the loud row and the quiet window side, so nobody is stuck by accident.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
